<title>USA: West TeleServices Corp Q4 net, revs rise.</title>
<headline>West TeleServices Corp Q4 net, revs rise.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter	  Year</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenue			  $82,022 $69,562 $317,210 $256,894</p>
<p> Cost of services		46,332  40,050  180,380  146,531</p>
